[size=5][b]NoMapDiscordAdditions[/b][/size]
Two map workflows on Valheim's large map:
[list=1]
[*][b]SEND MAP / COPY MAP[/b] — capture the visible map and either post it to a Discord webhook or paste it directly into Discord, Slack, or an image editor.
[*][b]MAP COMPILE[/b] — visit cartography tables one by one and stitch every reading into a single high-resolution PNG you can save, copy, or send to Discord.
[/list]
Built for no-map (and normal) servers. Message templates, output format, and tile-sharing policy can be [b]server-synced[/b] so a host enforces the same look for everyone.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codewithbjim/ValheimMods/refs/heads/main/NoMapDiscordAdditions/Thunderstore/Images/1.jpg[/img]
[line]
[size=4][b]Highlights[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]One-click sharing[/b] — SEND MAP posts to a Discord webhook; COPY MAP puts a full-resolution image on your clipboard. Hotkeys ([font=Courier New]F10[/font] / [font=Courier New]F11[/font]) shown on the buttons and rebindable.
[*][b]MAP COMPILE[/b] — walk between cartography tables, add each as a tile, and composite them into one coordinate-accurate PNG. Sessions persist per world + character and resume after a restart.
[*][b]Multiple sessions[/b] — keep several independent compile sessions per world (a full-world map alongside an expedition map); a [font=Courier New]SESSIONS[/font] panel opens, creates, and deletes them.
[*][b]Interactive WEB MAP[/b] — export a self-contained, offline web viewer (double-click [font=Courier New]index.html[/font], no server or internet needed) with drag-pan, zoom, a searchable pin list, and per-kind pin filtering over a pin-free base image.
[*][b]Manage Tiles[/b] — a [font=Courier New]TILES[/font] panel to review every captured tile and exclude any from the next compile without deleting it (or remove it outright), including imported tiles from tables you're nowhere near.
[*][b]PINS filter[/b] — choose exactly which pin kinds appear on a compiled map (mod-added pins included automatically).
[*][b]Tile sharing[/b] — pool map coverage with teammates by exchanging self-describing PNG tiles.
[*][b]Map styles[/b] — optional Old Map / Chart / Topographical / Satellite rendering for captures and compiled tiles.
[*][b]Clean shots[/b] — every UI overlay is hidden; [font=Courier New]Player[/font]/[font=Courier New]Death[/font] pins are dropped by default (hold Left CTRL to keep them).
[*][b]Output control[/b] — JPEG or indexed-PNG output, tuned to stay under Discord's attachment limit while keeping pin captions crisp.
[/list]
[b]Composed map (4 tables stitched):[/b]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/codewithbjim/ValheimMods/refs/heads/main/NoMapDiscordAdditions/Thunderstore/Images/2.png[/img]
