[line]
[size=4][b]Server behavior[/b][/size]
Config sync uses [url=https://thunderstore.io/c/valheim/p/ValheimModding/Jotunn/][b]Jotunn[/b][/url]'s [font=Courier New]SynchronizationManager[/font] (a required dependency). On connect, the server pushes its value for every synced setting, the entry is locked client-side, and each client's local value is restored on disconnect. Server-synced settings include the webhook URL, message templates, cloud-hiding, and the tile-sharing toggles; output format, map style, lighting, and hotkeys stay local to each client. See the [url=https://github.com/codewithbjim/ValheimMods/blob/main/NoMapDiscordAdditions/Thunderstore/WIKI.md#server-behavior--sync]Wiki[/url] for the full list.
[line]
